          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between DTF and UV DTF?",
            "answer": "<p>DTF is for fabric — heat pressed onto shirts, hoodies and bags. UV DTF is for hard surfaces such as cups, tumblers and keychains: no heat, peel and stick.</p>"
          }
        },
